<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Crompton &amp; Knowles.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Crompton &amp; Knowles.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of Crompton &amp; Knowles Corp and added the stock to its priority list, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
